        <text x="460" y="222" class="d-small" text-anchor="middle">Same bank data. Same question — “where did my money go last month?” — asked of a different architecture.</text>

        <text x="24" y="266" class="d-lab d-ok">WITH SNUG — THE LEDGER APP</text>

        <rect x="24" y="284" width="118" height="120" rx="3" class="d-box"></rect>
